# OpenClaw Secrets Template
# Copy to secrets.env and fill in your API keys:
#   cp secrets.template.env secrets.env
#
# secrets.env is ansible-vault encrypted before commit (pre-commit hook).
#
# Field checklist (set what you use; leave others commented or empty):
#   Required for LLM:     SKYAPI_API_KEY and/or ALIYUN_API_KEY (at least one)
#   Optional OpenRouter:  OPENROUTER_API_KEY
#   Optional messaging:   TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN (+ TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID for alerts)
#   Optional Tailscale:     TAILSCALE_AUTHKEY
#   Optional Longhorn S3:   S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID, S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, S3_ENDPOINT, S3_BUCKET, S3_REGION
#   Optional memory:      MEM0_API_KEY or SUPERMEMORY_API_KEY
#
# Verify Telegram + S3:   ./scripts/test-connectivity.sh
#
# Organized by PLATFORM. Each platform has its own API key and base URL.
# Model-to-platform mapping is in models.providers (agent YAML files).

# --- Platform: SkyAPI (Claude, GPT, etc.) ---
SKYAPI_API_KEY=sk-sky-xxx
SKYAPI_BASE_URL=https://api.skyapi.org

# --- Platform: Aliyun Bailian Coding Plan (Qwen, Kimi, GLM, MiniMax) ---
# ALIYUN_API_KEY=sk-sp-xxx
# ALIYUN_BASE_URL=https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/v1

# --- Platform: Anthropic (native, optional) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxx
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com

# --- Platform: OpenRouter (optional) ---
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-xxx

# --- Messaging + alerting (optional; one bot is enough for all agents) ---
# setup-secrets always creates Secret openclaw-channel-keys (token may be empty).
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:AA...        # @BotFather
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=-1001234567890          # private (positive id) or group (negative); for test-connectivity --send-telegram

# --- Memory system (optional, pick one) ---
# MEM0_API_KEY=m0-xxx
# SUPERMEMORY_API_KEY=sm-xxx

# --- Tailscale (optional) ---
# TAILSCALE_AUTHKEY=tskey-auth-xxx

# --- S3 Backup Target (for Longhorn; all five vars required to enable) ---
# Supports: Cloudflare R2, Backblaze B2, MinIO, AWS S3, Aliyun OSS
#
# S3_ENDPOINT must be the HTTPS API base URL (NOT the secret key).
# Cloudflare R2 example:
#   S3_ENDPOINT=https://abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
# (Account ID is in R2 overview; bucket name is separate in S3_BUCKET.)
#
# S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=r2_access_key_id_from_api_token
# S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=r2_secret_access_key_from_api_token
# S3_ENDPOINT=https://xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
# S3_BUCKET=openclaw-backup
# S3_REGION=auto
